OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,6,Fheavy showers in places. Showers
OL,7,Fbecome isolated and lighter into the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Staying cloudy on high
OL,10,Fground. Winds lighter than of late,
OL,11,Fbut feeling cool in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing overnight as
OL,14,Fcloud breaks, bringing some clearer
OL,15,Fspells in places. Winds turning very
OL,16,Flight which can lead to mist and fog,
OL,17,Fmostly in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
