OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly mist and fog will lift
OL,6,Fleaving bright and sunny spells during
OL,7,Fthe morning. Patchy cloud moves in
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon, but staying dry.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average for
OL,10,FOctober.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStaying
OL,13,Fsettled for the rest of the week as
OL,14,Fhigh pressure stays in charge in the
OL,15,Fsouth. Light winds will lead to mist
OL,16,Fand fog overnight and during the
OL,17,Fmornings.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
